; ---- permissive: the feed as Milhouse sees it ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.40,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Milhouse's point of view.\NNo sign-in. Anyone can look through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:05.20,Milh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}These are my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:10.20,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}Identity bar: permissive.\NOne vouch is enough to earn a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:10.20,Milh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Seymore and Amanda like\Nthe same movies I do!

; ---- back at the top: the moniker ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.90,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}A bad actor vouched for him\Nunder a name of their choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:16.10,Milh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}...why does it say 4-Eyes?

; ---- the setting ----
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:20.30,Narr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)}The Identity bar sets how many\Nindependent paths a name needs.
